<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Resource List</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 20px;
    font-size: 11pt;
  }
  th, td {
    padding: 10px 5px;
    text-align: left;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;
  }
  th {
    background-color: #f0f0f0;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .header-title {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 18pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .subtitle {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 14pt;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .section-heading {
    font-size: 14pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 30px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  .footer-info {
    margin-top: 50px;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 10pt;
  }
  .qr-code-container {
    text-align: center;
    margin: 40px 0;
  }
  .qr-code-placeholder {
    width: 150px;
    height: 150px;
    background-color: #eee;
    border: 1px solid #ccc;
    display: inline-block;
    line-height: 150px;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 10pt;
  }
  .step-container {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-around;
    margin-top: 30px;
  }
  .step {
    text-align: center;
    width: 30%;
  }
  .step-icon {
    font-size: 40pt;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center;">
    <div style="font-size: 30pt; font-weight: bold;">MANIPAL</div>
    <div style="font-size: 12pt;">ACADEMY OF HIGHER EDUCATION</div>
    <div style="font-size: 8pt;">(Institution of Eminence Deemed to be University)</div>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 40px;">
    <div style="font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold;">SEARCH – The KMC Health Sciences Library, Manipal</div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px; font-size: 11pt;">
    <p><strong>Know Your Online Resources (Databases/Journals/Books) @ Health Sciences Library</strong></p>
    <p>SEARCH - The <span data-field="library_name">{{ library_name }}</span>, MAHE, Manipal has access to the following Online Resources (Databases/Journals/Books) for the year <span data-field="current_year">{{ current_year }}</span> and same could be accessed through Health Sciences Library portal in the MAHE Campus at Manipal as well as remotely (Via OpenAthens) by the users of <span data-field="library_name">{{ library_name }}</span>, MAHE, Manipal.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section-heading">
    Table of Online Resources
  </div>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 5%;">Sl. No.</th>
        <th style="width: 30%;">Online Resources</th>
        <th style="width: 30%;">Category</th>
        <th style="width: 35%;">Brief Description</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for i in range(1, 37) %}
      {% set resource_data = get_resource_data(i) %}
      {% if resource_data %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ i }}</td>
        <td><span data-field="resources[{{ i-1 }}].name">{{ resource_data.name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="resources[{{ i-1 }}].category">{{ resource_data.category }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="resources[{{ i-1 }}].description">{{ resource_data.description }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center;">
    <div style="font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold;">Scan and Search your Online Resources</div>
  </div>

  <div class="qr-code-container">
    <div class="qr-code-placeholder">QR Code Placeholder</div>
  </div>

  <div class="step-container">
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-icon">&#x2191;</div>
      <div style="font-size: 11pt;">Step I: Scan the QR Code</div>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-icon">&#x2191;</div>
      <div style="font-size: 11pt;">Step II: Enter the Login Credentials</div>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-icon">&#x2191;</div>
      <div style="font-size: 11pt;">Step III: Search Your Library</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px; border-top: 1px solid #ccc; padding-top: 20px;">
    <div style="font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;">For more information contact:</div>
    <div style="font-size: 11pt;">SEARCH – The <span data-field="library_name">{{ library_name }}</span></div>
    <div style="font-size: 11pt;">MAHE, Manipal</div>
    <div style="font-size: 11pt;">Ph: <span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span></div>
    <div style="font-size: 11pt;">E-mail: <span data-field="email_address">{{ email_address }}</span></div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px; text-align: center;">
    <div style="font-size: 10pt;">Access Through:</div>
    <div style="font-size: 10pt;">&#x25B6; <span data-field="library_website_url">{{ library_website_url }}</span></div>
    <div style="font-size: 10pt;">&#x25B6; <span data-field="remote_access_url">{{ remote_access_url }}</span></div>
    <div style="font-size: 10pt;">OpenAthens</div>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>